  "text": "### 3. Reporting Lines  \n**Reports to:**\n- Full Board of Directors (Chair reports key decisions/issues)  \n**Receives from:**\n- Chief Risk Officer (risk management updates)\n- Chief Financial Officer (capital, financial risk)\n- Compliance Head (regulatory, AML/KYC)\n- Head of Internal Audit (audit findings)\n- Chief Technology Officer (technology risk)  \n**Accountability:**\n- Committee Chair accountable to Board\n- Board accountable to regulators (FCA, PRA)\n- Regulators may meet with committee directly",
